Hello,

the build (v3.3-rc5-97-g891003a  .config attached) was successful,
however I got the following warning(s) :


drivers/thermal/thermal_sys.c:63:21: warning: 'thermal_event_seqnum' defined but not used


due to the fact that CONFIG_NET isn't set. IMO the line #63 should be moved
into the "#ifdef CONFIG_NET" block, isn't it ?



The build was made with :
$>make randconfig; make clean; make

Here's the config:

